ld/id #uuid "00540470-d401-508e-a4c2-42380c6387e4" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440042} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cbd83f0c-4dda-5c08-94da-e086477d7693" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439371} {:answer/id #uuid "f72692ce-fcf9-534d-8c56-0c5925cd53bc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439372}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cbd83f0c-4dda-5c08-94da-e086477d7693" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439371} :answer-field/id #uuid "1eb40513-3590-5937-995c-4992f61ebca3" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440043}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "62ec00bb-a7dc-5ae8-ae64-a716f57687a2" :question/math-academy-id "q-102106" :question/problem "![](images/d9/d9cf9a5c61cbf1796cf6682b129b4c05171c364c7b34e7cce176ba27e9c9cb24.png)\n\nThe curve $y=f(x)$ is shown above. At which of the following points is $f(x)$ continuous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x=-1$\n- **II.** $x=2$\n- **III.** $x=4$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each point separately.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is continuous at $x=-1.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of $x=-1$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is continuous at $x=2.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of $x=2$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not continuous at $x=4.$ Since there is an asymptote at $x=4,$ it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=4$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\nHence, the correct answer is  \"I and II only\".\n\n![](images/95/95967eb82512aae261936a6c09e2f474c72c9a130d3ecb527f62408822d88c96.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186234403 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "26385865-8d0f-55a1-bd86-65b238cbbe40" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439955} {:answer/id #uuid "2ba5be98-ab6d-5eed-a69a-116bb223ca4d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439956}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "26385865-8d0f-55a1-bd86-65b238cbbe40" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439955} :answer-field/id #uuid "69ddde7e-1a9e-5dae-9da9-7e3ff40034bd" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440335} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "34ffcc78-4416-5f78-8eaf-65ba4096346d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439957} {:answer/id #uuid "94206a46-f33c-5db0-b3fb-83a6cfa82144" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439958}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "94206a46-f33c-5db0-b3fb-83a6cfa82144" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439958} :answer-field/id #uuid "84fd6c4d-6e21-5efa-83f3-2ac9abfac29b" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440336} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "743e9e46-5822-56a5-9b52-45a1659ac58a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439959} {:answer/id #uuid "2248cefc-5075-52e6-bf71-0791631d6477" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439960}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "743e9e46-5822-56a5-9b52-45a1659ac58a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439959} :answer-field/id #uuid "8b6eb503-6847-5008-b6a4-9a6aec54ba5f" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440337}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b9857052-b60b-5b90-a22b-cd84e32dabbe" :question/math-academy-id "q-78133" :question/problem "![](images/43/43544a1ba403055094cae54fed9772df353d3697f50888728ebee61e77b729da.png)\n\nThe curve $y=f(x)$ is shown above. At which of the following points is $f(x)$ continuous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x=-7$\n- **II.** $x=-4$\n- **III.** $x=-1$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each point separately.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not continuous at $x=-7.$ Because there is a jump at $x=-7,$ it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=-7$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is continuous at $x=-4.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of $x=-4$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not continuous at $x=-1.$ Since there is a break at $x=-1,$ it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=-1$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\nHence, the correct answer is: \"II only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237871 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d454d48-6ad7-52d0-ac60-83c0ac8f773e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437294} {:answer/id #uuid "14060581-f911-5f44-94a5-7b957230bdad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437295}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5d454d48-6ad7-52d0-ac60-83c0ac8f773e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437294} :answer-field/id #uuid "6be63faa-8d5a-5a49-b394-4700822c7c46" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438676} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08caed72-8840-52c2-b454-83fc6d66acbf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437296} {:answer/id #uuid "6f90d7b8-c269-587f-acdd-400474c83057" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437297}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "08caed72-8840-52c2-b454-83fc6d66acbf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437296} :answer-field/id #uuid "8742df6e-f57e-5e1f-8e45-f5d4e42d35f8" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438677} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c250cd71-3e9e-5986-aa4d-df4401ae5a2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437298} {:answer/id #uuid "f96ad967-28ee-58df-bef3-532adf94d6ec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437299}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "f96ad967-28ee-58df-bef3-532adf94d6ec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186437299} :answer-field/id #uuid "f10fa0a2-67c4-557a-b23c-de2310f1db3e" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438678}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a3b92036-278a-5fb6-a1d2-39caf6b31601" :question/math-academy-id "q-102115" :question/problem "![](images/d1/d1d91b2d791d69c512a6bd2e7d523563de076a7f3afda53513234e799152ef8d.png)\n\nThe curve $y=f(x)$ is shown above. At which of the following points is $f(x)$ continuous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x=-1$\n- **II.** $x=1$\n- **III.** $x=3$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each point separately.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not continuous at $x=-1.$ Since there is a jump at $x=-1,$ it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=-1$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not continuous at $x=1.$ Since there is a break at $x=1,$ it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=1$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is continuous at $x=3.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of $x=3$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\nHence, the correct answer is  \"III only\".\n\n \n\n![](images/57/57415045f7a1cc1c896756ff19cb17f90074151a25d12c56068fb6f86a064753.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186336004 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "68f016cd-f1df-5564-b277-b9ece07b1add" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/42/42e1d99095fd174c1e9eb1835cf0a26f16d58ce9392a7654ad0fd0526fd35add.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333951} {:answer/id #uuid "6f9f44b0-368f-559a-b2a5-34548d645434" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d1/d124370f929cdd5f42cabe0f2588e668fb90a8e8abbd2140fe9db33d3e3b2fbf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334006} {:answer/id #uuid "e6fbc9e1-c840-5d83-b28b-d761b9044e3e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/17/17fc3c79ab7a2e3e6d724821e9e43e66f35881d068b68a04332aa028dc51bd1a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335006} {:answer/id #uuid "ebc73aff-3ed2-576e-8a12-52412bd890b7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/76/76a1b2ca2dd29f0689693b1ed347c3e7f2c4359b2760f5934f661643eb6a5a64.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335053} {:answer/id #uuid "f379af21-00b7-5d16-a491-ec53069d2b3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/13/135973e3013842e2313f678d8538288a7f6bf7612ea30bf4e69791a1efcd559a.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335123}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6f9f44b0-368f-559a-b2a5-34548d645434" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d1/d124370f929cdd5f42cabe0f2588e668fb90a8e8abbd2140fe9db33d3e3b2fbf.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334006} :answer-field/id #uuid "9f84de5c-4838-586d-b50e-95004b3f22d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335536}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "e470e82c-c1d4-5e27-9c41-1a58d40dcb44" :question/math-academy-id "q-69782" :question/problem "Select the function that is continuous at $x=5.$" :question/worked-solution "Of the given options, the only one where we can draw the graph of the function without taking our pencil off of the paper in a neighborhood of $x=5$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/d8/d8720531a6a06d2192ff76b04c9038e6029fa2c8844e5315d416dbbe11f38cc5.png)\n\nAll other given options have breaks or asymptotes at $x=5$, so it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=5$ without taking our pencil off of the paper."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348065 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e5fd155-2504-5c3d-a760-bbd99e1090d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438556} {:answer/id #uuid "3b0e24f3-ce37-5763-9295-e6dcfa80516c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438557}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4e5fd155-2504-5c3d-a760-bbd99e1090d8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438556} :answer-field/id #uuid "d98b4e36-f754-5f8e-bd6c-0164a8d0f3ea" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439307} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "339ca849-02ce-5f14-afec-2afc13e8fbc8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438558} {:answer/id #uuid "16e24b1c-b99b-54e6-a8a6-c2cfc6a9da25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438559}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "16e24b1c-b99b-54e6-a8a6-c2cfc6a9da25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438559} :answer-field/id #uuid "fab6096a-58f6-53d6-ab1a-1dd97f58f66c" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439308} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c2e4c5ff-fa8f-5af9-bf9a-d13017c08215" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438560} {:answer/id #uuid "8af1dfd5-2070-592d-b874-1cb1f74e406f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438561}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8af1dfd5-2070-592d-b874-1cb1f74e406f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438561} :answer-field/id #uuid "89f56e5e-3a14-5faf-a080-0894eaa3014f" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439309}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "4ac549bb-41f9-5150-895e-d407a77f8e37" :question/math-academy-id "q-78131" :question/problem "![](images/3c/3c0dc4b8f7f45a5bc1177778431eccf9bcaac1bf6d520d605f9e6bc08d5b1d91.png)\n\nThe curve $y=f(x)$ is shown above. At which of the following points is $f(x)$ continuous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x=-2$\n\n- **II.** $x=0$\n\n- **III.** $x=2$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each point separately.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not continuous at $x=-2.$ Since there is an asymptote at $x=-2,$ it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=-2$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is continuous at $x=0.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of $x=0$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is continuous at $x=2.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of $x=2$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"II and III only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348066 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fb0a1672-dd92-5734-afb4-6c205257b887" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438562} {:answer/id #uuid "e942f1fc-8911-5c8e-a43d-5d52f7b2bda4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438563}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e942f1fc-8911-5c8e-a43d-5d52f7b2bda4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438563} :answer-field/id #uuid "fedb0bc1-169f-5c83-95af-19ec64456b7c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439310} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9f42a529-24fd-59f0-9297-1746269c7943" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438564} {:answer/id #uuid "c40c6655-c97b-52ba-9be1-322c18582fe2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438565}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9f42a529-24fd-59f0-9297-1746269c7943" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438564} :answer-field/id #uuid "dae62b32-8b78-5f87-bf11-8dff313b3f34" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439311} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b5d3f2a6-df6b-53b2-ab14-7b5282ce5e2a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438566} {:answer/id #uuid "06a3e8bb-3a51-5020-ab0a-eb1cef3d4c5b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438567}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "06a3e8bb-3a51-5020-ab0a-eb1cef3d4c5b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186438567} :answer-field/id #uuid "13499535-8225-5f59-b066-6b78ad157fbd" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439312}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "5c2c6cc4-6d0f-5ca4-bd69-989208f699b4" :question/math-academy-id "q-78132" :question/problem "![](images/89/890e7eaf519a65ca19d4a90b604e7d7a8ab7054635296c4b08f000546f23b545.png)\n\nThe curve $y=f(x)$ is shown above. At which of the following points is $f(x)$ continuous?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $x=-2$\n\n- **II.** $x=1$\n\n- **III.** $x=3$" :question/worked-solution "Let's consider each point separately.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is continuous at $-2.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of $x=-2$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- The function $f(x)$ is not continuous at $x=1.$ Since there is a jump at $x=1,$ it is impossible to draw the function in the neighborhood of $x=1$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\n- Therefore, the function $f(x)$ is continuous $x=3.$ The graph can be drawn in the neighborhood of  $x=3$ without taking our pencil off of the paper.\n\nHence, the correct answer is  \"I and III only\".\n\n![](images/7c/7c96c401ddae0049859fd5608cb08c6ce9ae8a2e6c3db69d7d4b379b3824094e.png)"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186392615 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e5cffd7b-e09a-5e8f-9bc6-d30e9bf80623" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c6/c6f0914f0b218164bc99fdefe7d83dffe4591a6b704e2243013d05c2b117ef17.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392617} {:answer/id #uuid "3ba0ee0f-2ced-5835-84e5-0ed53e1549d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/c2/c2f85d1a2becc7bfe6f71d7f6fcb178f4707f4b41956015eabb38610de95feca.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392618} {:answer/id #uuid "d5853982-4adc-5148-b192-1f951c92f732" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/14/14349b3dee80a6d451efedc55b91b5e709139f1a93fabf539d605843513f6141.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186392619} {:answer/i